WEBVTT

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.450
Sophie, I was waiting for you.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.170
Brother...?

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:46.850
I was finally able to bring
you here, to El Dorado.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:47.980
Huh?

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:08.920
B-Brother, what is this place?
You said this was El Dorado?

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.590
This is a world I've created.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:15.630
A world where anyone
can live happily. A true utopia.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:22.140
I'm sorry for making you feel so lonely.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:25.100
From now on, we'll always be together.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:23.090
10 years ago, I confirmed
your scorched corpse with my own eyes.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.240
Are you an illusion created by Horrors?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.810
Or something from the ELDO NET?

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:50.540
As expected of the Golden Knight.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:58.590
I can't prove that I am really the girl
named Lizzy, Elizabeth Ragnvald.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.590
I don't plan to, either.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.090
The only thing I'm sure of,

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:08.060
is that I have information
and want to give it to you.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:09.100
Information?

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:14.190
The reason this true El Dorado was created

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.650
and information on the Horror that began it.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.120
He's breathing.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:53.280
Y-You muscle-headed idiot!
Don't cause me trouble!

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.940
Looks like I won't be able
to just force my way through.

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:11.830
Looks like you're in trouble...

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.650
...Handsome.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.010
Come on, Sophie!

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:26.050
I'll show you around my El Dorado!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.970
W-Wait, Brother!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.510
Are you going out, Master?

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:32.470
Yeah.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:38.690
I want to show my little sister,
El Dorado. Make preparations.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:39.980
Understood.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.360
B-Brother, that person!

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.820
Oh, she's my secretary, Miss Queen.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:52.620
She organizes my entire schedule
and handles company communications.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.620
That's not what I mean! She's...!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:59.670
Thank you for waiting.
I have reserved the Café Soleil for 14:00.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.540
Thank you.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:01.590
Please enjoy yourselves.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.630
Let's go, Sophie!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.630
I was waiting for this day to finally come!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:23.730
El Dorado is a system that I created,

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:28.020
a virtual city that stimulates all five senses.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:34.380
In this city, each person can
obtain a meaningful job and work.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.790
Are you hungry?

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.250
Huh? Oh.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.460
Yeah...

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:52.740
Here.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.230
You can enjoy any flavor here.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:07.650
As well as any recreation.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:14.110
A reality that surpasses reality.
That is what El Dorado is...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.370
Hey there!

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.040
How rare for you to be out of the tower.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.080
Hello.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.210
It has been a long time, El Dorado King!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.210
Huh?!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.840
Who is the young lady there?

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.970
She's my little sister.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.050
El Dorado is finally reaching completion!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:36.680
I was finally able to call her here.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.310
Well, congratulations!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.560
So El Dorado is finally going to be complete.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.630
This is all thanks to your hard work, King!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.030
Um, Brother?

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:56.990
Hm?

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:01.660
The King of El Dorado
who was searching for me...

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:04.330
Could it be...?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:08.170
Yeah, it was me.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.420
I asked Queen.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:14.930
Since El Dorado is almost complete,
I wanted her to go and get you.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:19.470
Although, I'm just the
administrator of the system.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:24.940
Everyone keeps calling me King.
Such an exaggeration!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.280
It's as you say.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.450
I died a long time ago.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:42.030
My body was destroyed and only
my soul was absorbed into this world.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:50.090
Everyone living here is the same as me.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.590
Our souls were all stolen by El Dorado.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:09:00.060
The bodies in the real world
lose their masters and die.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:07.230
This world is created by
souls the Horrors have hunted,

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.190
a world for them to feast.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:12.280
El Dorado King.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.810
The everlasting king. The ancient one.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:22.490
An ancient Horror of many names
spent over 10 years making this city.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:42.220
10 years ago, that huge explosion
created by Cygnusram-Tech.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:48.400
At the time, they were
doing research on brain function

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:53.330
and how they could connect
the brain to a bigger virtual network.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.470
That caught the interest of the ancient Horror.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.120
He infiltrated Cygnusram-Tech

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.040
and completed the
base theory of ELDO NET there.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:09.960
However, Makai Knights discovered his plans...

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.880
After a fierce battle,

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.630
the ancient Horror
self-destructed with his research.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.380
Everyone thought his ambition ended there.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.510
But he survived.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.540
And so did his El Dorado prototype.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.730
That was when my soul was caught.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:33.680
Though, everyone else who met
my fate were immediately eaten.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.620
The only reason I managed to escape until now

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.700
is because of the Golden Knight bloodline.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.410
You, too.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:49.420
Me, too?

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.040
The Golden Knight will not die.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.280
Not by something trivial
like having his soul taken.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:11.940
They've noticed us!

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.690
Those are bots created to
destroy abnormalities in the system!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:18.280
Weren't those all souls
absorbed into the system?!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:21.530
That's right. They normally have their own will.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:25.830
But in the end, they've become
a part of the El Dorado system!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.720
El Dorado King is my brother...

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.240
S-Sophie?!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:05.740
What's wrong, Sophie? Don't cry.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.450
This is the room I prepared for you, Sophie.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.810
I'm sorry, Sophie.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.390
You must have been so lonely.

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.560
The contract with the GarEden corporation.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:38.530
I couldn't tell my family about
my involvement with the El Dorado Project.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.560
Brother...

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:47.030
Even though it was a really
important job, I left you alone.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.910
For a whole half a year...

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.660
Half a year?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:58.130
Did the social worker from the
GarEden Corporation treat you well?

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.800
You sounded like you were
doing well from your letters, so...

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.050
You're wrong...

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.800
You're wrong, Brother!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.260
Three years!

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.050
It's been three years since you disappeared!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:08.850
Huh?

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:12.490
Me, too. This isn't what
I look like in the real world.

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:14.640
I'm already thirteen now!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:18.730
I was taken in by an
orphanage after you disappeared.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:22.480
I was looking for you this whole time!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.990
Also! The El Dorado outside!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:28.320
The real El Dorado is
a city controlled by Horrors!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.620
Horrors? Like from a movie?

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:34.790
No! Horrors are monsters that eat people!

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:38.790
Everyone who gathered to
El Dorado have been eaten and died!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:42.840
Calm down, Sophie. There are no monsters here.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.340
Where is my real brother?

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.590
My actual... physical self?

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:56.270
My physical body is in a special room
at the main GarEden tower.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.650
Then, let's hurry and get out of here!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.980
You can't stay in a fake world like this!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:03.070
It's all right, Sophie.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.280
If you stay here,
there's nothing to be afraid of.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.280
But...!

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:14.240
This El Dorado was created
to give everyone true happiness.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:18.000
And I am the creator
and administrator of this place.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.710
This is the proof.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:26.470
As long as I have this ring,
everything will go as I plan.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:32.220
That who possesses the
ring controls the horror within,

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:35.060
making any desire a reality.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:40.690
Take it off! Take it off right now!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.110
You can't use the power of Horrors!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.360
Please, take it off!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:49.240
This is proof of my strength!
The proof I made El Dorado.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:53.870
What in the world are
you talking about? Horrors?

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.260
Because of that ring. Because of Horrors...

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:05.670
So many... So many people have died!

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:07.760
Sophie...

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:12.760
Why? I just wanted to make you happy?

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:17.850
Could it be that a rival
company put something in your head?

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.140
No! I've...!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.270
Now that I think of it,

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:26.020
there've been reports of company
spies entering the other El Dorado.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:29.030
Are those the Horrors?

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.530
No! Listen to me, Brother!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.070
Sophie, you're being tricked!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.220
Come here.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.290
Stand back!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:09.610
After the ancient Horror obtained
the prototype from Cygnusram-Tech,

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:13.570
he infiltrated the GarEden Corporation
to continue his research.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:19.080
Then, he discovered a genius stuck
in the ghetto named Martin Hennes.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:21.960
Sophie's big brother.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.750
The Horror gave him a ring.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:28.170
The Horrors controlled
by the ring followed his orders

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:31.150
and he completed El Dorado.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:36.300
Soon, El Dorado will be connected
to networks throughout the world

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.540
and the hunt for human souls will begin.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:43.390
Take down the Horror and destroy this system!

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:47.480
Free all of the souls captured here!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.910
In the name of Golden Knight.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.790
This place has everything.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:10.130
Human wisdom, eternal peace,

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:12.510
and overflowing abundance.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:16.970
All of this is yours, Sophie.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.390
But, this is only the start.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:25.020
One thousand people
joined during the alpha testing.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.520
Three thousand during the beta testing.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.070
Five thousand when version 1.0 was released.

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.570
Right now, in El Dorado 2.0,

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:38.070
there are ten thousand
living here from the real world!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:48.710
And soon, El Dorado will connect
to networks throughout the world.

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:53.170
All of mankind will be able
to live in this ideal world!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.980
Brother...

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:58.580
Hm?

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:05.350
Do you know how many people
have died because of your...?

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:15.540
Brother! It's okay, this girl is still alive!

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:18.780
Sophie!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.490
Sword?!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.640
Brother!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.410
Sword!

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:47.600
What was that?

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.240
What's wrong, Sophie?

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.570
Lizzy!

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:48.350
Save that girl and destroy El Dorado!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.310
Hi, Sleepyhead.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:14.150
I'm... back?

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.470
Were you able to go to the true El Dorado?

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.190
What are the Horrors planning?

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:24.910
Where are you going?!

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:29.530
I'm going to save Sophie!

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:00.440
Sophie?

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:18.590
Sophie, why?

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:25.860
These are all the people
who died because of your El Dorado.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:59.950
The dead don't return.

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:05.170
A person who has become
a Horror can never change back.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:10.470
If so... If so!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:17.480
I will kill my brother myself!
